    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        375,
        1502,
        2490,
        1799
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "During the past few months, city labor management dis-\ncussions have covered the driving of crew-served motor vehicles\nby crew members who do not have the title of Motor Vehicle Oper-\nator - an arrangement most favorable to efficient and economical\nadministration.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3271,
          "min": -1.5183
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0159,
          "min": -0.3647
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 93973,
        "area_px": 3958080,
        "density": 0.02374,
        "chars": 264,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 2.81
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        380,
        1828,
        2537,
        2305
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "One condition necessary to the accomplishment of\nthis desirable arrangement is strict adherence to the companion\nrequirement that city agencies assign only motor vehicle oper-\nators to drive vehicles which are not crew served. Administrative\nOrder No. 8 carried instructions designed to eliminate all out-\nof-title assignments to drive motor vehicles, since the practice\nof making such assignments hampers the city's effort to fulfill\nthe requirements of the labor agreements.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3177,
          "min": -1.7868
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 88,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0265
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 186802,
        "area_px": 6482875,
        "density": 0.02881,
        "chars": 476,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 2.55
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        385,
        2320,
        2545,
        2687
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I wish therefore to reemphasize the importance of the\ninstructions concerning out-of-title drivers assignments con-\ntained in Administrative Order No. 8; and the requirement that all\nagencies comply at once with these instructions. There is no\njustification for out-of-title assignment of even one employee\nas a motor vehicle operator.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2999,
          "min": -1.8598
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
